  paper_info:
    title: "RICE: Refining Deep Reinforcement Learning Agents via Importance-based Critical State Exploration"
    core_contribution: "A framework that uses a mask network to explain DRL agent decisions by identifying critical states, then refines the agent by restarting training from a mixed initial distribution (default + critical states) with an exploration bonus (RND). The method provides both faithful explanations and performance improvements across diverse domains (MuJoCo, blockchain, cybersecurity, autonomous driving, malware)."

